   Stock: bills from QB_STOCK_FROM onwards (after the 21 Oct 2026 stock count) take the items out of that store; older ones were already
   inside the counted stock. A QueueBuster bill whose items match an app bill of the same store and day is marked "Also billed in app"
   and counted once. */
const PS_TAB = 'POS Sales', PS_H = ['Bill ID', 'Invoice no.', 'Date', 'Time', 'Location', 'Billed by (QueueBuster)', 'Items', 'Gross ₹', 'Discount ₹', 'Tax ₹',
  'Total ₹', 'Cash ₹', 'UPI ₹', 'Card ₹', 'Other ₹', 'Payment', 'Status', 'Stock moved', 'Note', 'Imported at'];
