// the store, its address / FSSAI on the bill, the Bill Lines and Short Payments rows change, and the stock moves with it:
// "Sale moved to another store" (+ back at the old store, ref INV-BILLMV-<no>) and "Sale (bill) – moved in" (− at the new store,
